In short, Used: 
Libraries: pandas, numpy, sklearn, keras, and matplotlib.
Data Prep: train_test_split, SimpleImputer (for NaNs), StandardScaler (scaling), and OneHotEncoder (categorical variables).
Deep Learning: A Sequential neural network with Dense layers, BatchNormalization (training speed), Dropout (preventing overfitting), and EarlyStopping (patience-based termination).
Used ML models : LightGBM, Adaboost, Logistic reg, Gradient Boosting, Xgboost and achieved max accuracy of 92.4% using Light GBM. Compared the result with ANN that gave a accuracy of 92.3% performing almost same.
